      "text": "Figure 4, \"Overview of labour market components supported by the NHWA modules\". Four rectangular boxes arranged in three tiers correspond to the layout of the health labour market framework: across the top, \"Finance and expenditures (Module 3)\"; in the middle row, \"Education (Module 2)\" on the left and \"Stock and flow (Module 1)\" on the right; and across the bottom, \"Working conditions, governance and leadership (Module 4)\".",
